                    <h1 class="public-hero-title">Premier Comfort Across 40 Exquisite Rooms</h1>
                    <p class="public-hero-desc">
                        Experience bespoke luxury and warm Tanzanian hospitality. Choose from 40 well-appointed rooms across 5 floors with seamless room-service dining and personalized guest care.
